What Lies Beneath is a drama, horror, mystery film directed by Robert Zemeckis.

3
00:17:43,636 --> 00:17:49,636
Norman and Claire Spencer are a seemingly happily married couple who uncover a
terrible secret… a secret so disturbing it threatens to destroy them.

4
